I just think everyone should
at least-- since it's free

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:42.480
right now, people should
check out Stackdriver, try it.

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:43.530
If they've got a
cross cloud load

00:22:43.530 --> 00:22:44.890
they should totally
try it there and they

00:22:44.890 --> 00:22:46.264
can see how awesome
it is to have

00:22:46.264 --> 00:22:48.950
their AWS on their
GCP resources side

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:50.926
by side in their dashboard.

00:22:50.926 --> 00:22:52.800
The example I did for
one of the talks I gave

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:57.620
recently was I did in MySQL
Cluster that was half in GCP

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:58.620
