00:23:18.780 --> 00:23:20.525
And seeing that side
by side as someone

00:23:20.525 --> 00:23:21.900
who's done a
combination of cloud

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:24.170
and on prem, as
someone who's done

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.250
cross cloud as part of
disaster recovery and all

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:27.650
that, it was really nice.

00:23:27.650 --> 00:23:30.110
And it made me wish I
had these features back

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:33.210
when I was responsible
for keeping a site up.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:35.770
So I think people, while it's
