00:24:16.170 --> 00:24:16.450
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:18.980
Finally you can detect if
your data center is on fire.

00:24:18.980 --> 00:24:19.900
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:24.370
I think I want to set up custom
metrics with smoke detectors

00:24:24.370 --> 00:24:26.654
so that they can send
